# Where the "Join the Forge" newsletter sends signups.
#
# The form POSTs { "email": "you@example.com" } as JSON. Point this at anything
# that accepts that shape, for example:
#
#   * Formspree (no backend needed)  ->  VITE_NEWSLETTER_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID
#   * Your own serverless function   ->  VITE_NEWSLETTER_ENDPOINT=https://your-domain/api/newsletter
#
# If you want a branded welcome email from your own domain, run Resend behind a
# serverless function (the API key must stay server-side) and have that function
# forward the signup here. Copy this file to .env and fill it in.
VITE_NEWSLETTER_ENDPOINT=
